{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0333_1000_017kth", "source_sha256": "fe4b7b7b32eda78d95ecbfad636e2dc9edc955304c6f37fce59e9bb58a095961", "ja": "ふぅ……。\n少し厳しく言い過ぎちゃったかな。でも……。", "zh": "呼……。\n刚才是不是说得有点太严厉了。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0333_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3cc91c96f531e02d9e82be63a9b06cdbcbd56ec5bbe8e7b6c7a973e04f504029", "ja": "どうしたんだ琴葉、悩み事か？", "zh": "琴叶，怎么了？有烦恼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0333_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "77de539dae0422737bc6e675942271e39d25fd7183d918ad0977d9ea017ce6cc", "ja": "あっ……お疲れ様です、{$P$}。\nさっき、控室でサッカーをしている子たちがいて……。", "zh": "啊……辛苦了，{$P$}。\n刚才，休息室里有几个孩子在踢足球……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0333_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "b9c48c197ef051e0fc97031335412c09ea481a46dd451d2f366fc5ac238141a3", "ja": "室内で遊ぶのは危険だから、声をかけたんです。\nただ、言い方がきつくなってしまったかも……。", "zh": "在室内玩太危险了，所以我上去说了两句。\n只是，我的语气可能有点太重了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0333_1004_p", "source_sha256": "bcf0031364e720e9208f12d309d087dc0d6ca878566a190b164fa39a5b67f8e9", "ja": "そうか……。琴葉としては、\n優しく注意したつもりだったんだろ？", "zh": "这样啊……对琴叶来说，\n应该是想温柔地提醒她吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0333_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "052cfb3aaeae085d79390ea9902154cac335707112135d0544efa8964104a0ec", "ja": "はい。この前、演じた警察官みたいに。\n言葉のひとつひとつに、思いやりが溢れていて……。", "zh": "是的。就像之前出演的警察一样。\n每一句话里都充满了体贴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0333_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "f06a496c0ba629025696ac8f0aa55362bf8a9d9d87a49fae247d4a817657b6ae", "ja": "注意された人も嫌な気持ちにならない、\n優しい言い方ができたらって思ったんですけど……。", "zh": "我希望自己能用一种温柔的说法，让被提醒的人也不会感到不舒服……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0333_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3bb0d1318284bad3d4df3c9e1ca069493921f35c26aae07c8386bf25cad8124f", "ja": "なるほどな。大丈夫、琴葉の気持ちは、\n注意された人もわかってると思うよ。", "zh": "原来如此。没事，我觉得琴叶的心情，被提醒的人也能理解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0333_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8664432e0e69047efb6dd09db29bce3292f7f6c69d380d49ea7f609848c317c8", "ja": "それにしても、琴葉は演技を通して、\n人としても成長してるのかもしれないな。", "zh": "话说回来，琴叶或许也在通过演技，逐渐成长为更成熟的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0333_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "60d92bece416fcf3e634f97252339dc19c5635a833a62fcad5276f7e34fb7cba", "ja": "そ、そうでしょうか？\nきちんと成長できてるか、あまり実感は……。", "zh": "是、是这样吗？\n我不太能切实感受到自己是否真的有所成长……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0333_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c85ff2b7dbf8eb2492fb5be009e6624fe1bf2790d09d1cb81124157ba2c5970e", "ja": "ははっ、そういうものだよ。少しずつ積み重なって、\nふとした瞬間に感じるんだと思う。", "zh": "哈哈，就是这样的。点点滴滴地积累下来，我想，到了某个不经意的瞬间，你就会感受到它。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0333_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "536b99622dbc281447374728495bfc5726e879bc677433a066db8f4cd0e070c9", "ja": "少しずつ……。そうですね。\n注意の仕方は、私なりにもう少しがんばってみます。", "zh": "一点点……也是呢。\n关于提醒别人的方式，我也会按自己的步调再努力改进一下的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0333_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "a2a485de984593095b17a51d4bf0f3511f76ebb5cd34a0da77b1df5211220b7e", "ja": "あれ？　ネクタイ、少し曲がってますよ。人に会う\nお仕事ですから、身だしなみは気をつけてください。", "zh": "哎？领带稍微有点歪了哦。毕竟是\n要见人的工作，仪表方面还请多注意一些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0333_1013_p", "source_sha256": "97a5e485b621f7c8772bbcf0ec150791df4372e8bca9fc04450f9a34e49f9d30", "ja": "ん？　ああ、本当だ……。\n教えてくれてありがとう。", "zh": "嗯？啊，真的歪了……\n谢谢你提醒我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0333_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "46387c6c5e6510f5eae0232de005b05c1591165db81c0f1e2b9bbdc6e4003e93", "ja": "あ、髪の毛も。後ろの方が少し跳ねちゃってます。\nふふっ、かわいい。……ハッ、何でもありません！", "zh": "啊，头发也是。后面的头发稍微翘起来了。\n呵呵，好可爱。……啊，没什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0333_1015_p", "source_sha256": "5b1622fb07b31b24c661b6df4acbd8fff0429e981b990a585de526210824098c", "ja": "（琴葉のおかげで、いつになく身だしなみが整った。\nなんだか気分も清々しい……。よし、仕事頑張ろう！）", "zh": "（多亏了琴叶，我今天的仪容比平时整洁多了。感觉心情也神清气爽……好，努力工作吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
